<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher.Top $61.25 per cwt. - USDA US 1-3    220-260 lbs   61.00-61.25</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs   60.00-60.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 1.00-2.00 higher. Top 50.00. US 1-3    350-450 lbs   47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs   48.50-49.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs   49.50-50.00</p>
</text>
